This week in Linear

Triage intelligence
Incoming issues from Slack, Intercom, and email are now grouped by similarity and get a suggested team and assignee automatically. Turn it on under Settings > Triage.

Project health
Project leads can mark a project On track, At risk, or Off track with a short update. Health rolls up into initiatives so you get a single view across teams.

SLAs
Set a response and resolution SLA per team and per issue priority. Breaches show up in views and can trigger Slack notifications.

Also shipped: a keyboard shortcut for cycling through issue views (Cmd+Shift+J), faster board rendering with 500+ issues, and a refreshed Figma embed.

Full changelog: https://linear.app/changelog/2026-08-27

